              },
              "content": "嗒啦～。\n欢迎来到「星球季」的活动现场——\n<style=Highlight>「奇物商城」</style>！",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1303001_3223616416_content",
                "value": "嗒啦～。\n欢迎来到「星球季」的活动现场——\n<style=Highlight>「奇物商城」</style>！",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 3223616416
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "鹊可",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1303001_3223616417_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "目前正在举办的是、\n为庆贺所有星球诞生伊始的纪念活动——\n<style=Highlight>「种星奇遇季」</style>。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1303001_3223616417_content",
                "value": "目前正在举办的是、\n为庆贺所有星球诞生伊始的纪念活动——\n<style=Highlight>「种星奇遇季」</style>。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 3223616417
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "鹊可",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1303001_3223616418_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "请随我来，为您逐一介绍。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1303001_3223616418_content",
                "value": "请随我来，为您逐一介绍。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 3223616418
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "鹊可",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1303001_3223616419_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "往<style=Highlight>进门右侧</style>的环形路走，陈列着许多礼品，\n<style=Highlight>左侧</style>是使用<style=Highlight>奇迹络米</style>，\n就可以直接兑换的、活动专属礼品的专区。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1303001_3223616419_content",
                "value": "往<style=Highlight>进门右侧</style>的环形路走，陈列着许多礼品，\n<style=Highlight>左侧</style>是使用<style=Highlight>奇迹络米</style>，\n就可以直接兑换的、活动专属礼品的专区。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 3223616419
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "鹊可",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1303001_3223616420_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "「种星奇遇季」活动举行期间，\n通过<style=Highlight>足迹手册</style>的每日任务，\n可获取<style=Highlight>奇迹络米</style>，兑换您喜欢的礼品。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1303001_3223616420_content",
                "value": "「种星奇遇季」活动举行期间，\n通过<style=Highlight>足迹手册</style>的每日任务，\n可获取<style=Highlight>奇迹络米</style>，兑换您喜欢的礼品。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 3223616420
            },
